Experimental micro-core. Not a Forth profile.

MCPU_0.1a.v is vendored from https://github.com/cpldcpu/MCPU
(Tim Böscke, 2001). Upstream readme licenses that source under GPL-2.
standalone.v is the fsoc pin wrapper around that module.

This directory stays under GPL-2. The rest of the repository is not
relicensed by these files.
